<p id="S3.SS1.p17.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.p17.1.1" class="ltx_text">and dimension vector <math id="S3.SS1.p17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{pmatrix}d&amp;d&amp;5dC_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}\cdot\boldsymbol{1}_{1\times n}&amp;dC_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}\end{pmatrix}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt"><mtr><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd><mtd><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{pmatrix}d&amp;d&amp;5dC_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}\cdot\boldsymbol{1}_{1\times n}&amp;dC_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math> such that for <math id="S3.SS1.p17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in\left[K^{dn}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in\left[K^{dn}\right]</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
