<p id="S3.SS1.p25.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.p25.4.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="S3.SS1.p25.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{i}^{(mnm)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{i}^{(mnm)}</annotation></semantics></math> is short for <math id="S3.SS1.p25.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{FF,i}^{(mnm)}\left(\boldsymbol{\bar{X}}^{(flt)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑿</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{FF,i}^{(mnm)}\left(\boldsymbol{\bar{X}}^{(flt)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. Denoting</span></p>
<table id="S3.EGx100" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.Ex143"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex143.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\boldsymbol{W}^{sum}:=\begin{pmatrix}\boldsymbol{I}_{d\times d}&amp;\boldsymbol{I}_{d\times d}&amp;\cdots&amp;\boldsymbol{I}_{d\times d}\end{pmatrix}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times dC_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝑾</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>𝑰</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>𝑰</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>⋯</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>𝑰</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\boldsymbol{W}^{sum}:=\begin{pmatrix}\boldsymbol{I}_{d\times d}&amp;\boldsymbol{I}_{d\times d}&amp;\cdots&amp;\boldsymbol{I}_{d\times d}\end{pmatrix}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times dC_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS1.p25.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.p25.5.1" class="ltx_text">then for <math id="S3.SS1.p25.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{X}\in\Omega_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑿</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{X}\in\Omega_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> with some <math id="S3.SS1.p25.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in\left[K^{dn}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in\left[K^{dn}\right]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.p26" class="ltx_para">
<table id="S3.EGx101" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.Ex144"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex144.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\boldsymbol{W}^{(sum)}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}^{(prl-mtp)}\circ\boldsymbol{T}^{(prl)}\circ\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}^{(mid)}\circ\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{X})=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑾</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑻</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑿</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\boldsymbol{W}^{(sum)}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}^{(prl-mtp)}\circ\boldsymbol{T}^{(prl)}\circ\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}^{(mid)}\circ\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{X})=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex145"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex145.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{pmatrix}\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{11}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)&amp;\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{12}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)&amp;\cdots&amp;\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{1n}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)\\
\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{21}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)&amp;\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{22}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)&amp;\cdots&amp;\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{2n}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)\\
\vdots&amp;\vdots&amp;\ddots&amp;\vdots\\
\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{d1}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)&amp;\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{d2}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)&amp;\cdots&amp;\sum_{i=1}^{C_{s+dn-1}^{dn-1}}\widetilde{\times}\left(c_{i,j}(f_{dn}),f_{i}^{(mnm)}\right)\end{pmatrix}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msubsup><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">×</mo><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">11</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd><mrow><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msubsup><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">×</mo><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">12</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd><mo mathsize="0.900em">⋯</mo></mtd><mtd><mrow><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msubsup><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">×</mo><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub