<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex222.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\begin{pmatrix}\boldsymbol{x}\\
\boldsymbol{1}_{1\times n}\\
