<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex273.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq P\left|\left(\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(i)}-\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(j)}\right)\boldsymbol{w}^{\prime}\right|-P\left|\left(\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(i)}-\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\bar{x}}}^{(i)}\right)\boldsymbol{w}^{\prime}\right|-P\left|\left(\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(j)}-\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\bar{x}}}^{(j)}\right)\boldsymbol{w}^{\prime}\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq P\left|\left(\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(i)}-\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(j)}\right)\boldsymbol{w}^{\prime}\right|-P\left|\left(\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(i)}-\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\bar{x}}}^{(i)}\right)\boldsymbol{w}^{\prime}\right|-P\left|\left(\boldsymbol{{\bar{x}}}^{(j)}-\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\bar{x}}}^{(j)}\right)\boldsymbol{w}^{\prime}\right|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
