\boldsymbol{0}_{d^{(2)}\times S^{(1)}}\end{pmatrix},\quad\boldsymbol{W}_{V,h,1}^{(prl)}:=\begin{pmatrix}\boldsymbol{W}_{V,h}^{(1)}&amp;\boldsymbol{0}_{S^{(1)}\times d^{(2)}}\end{pmatrix},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
