<p id="S6.p9.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p9.6.1" class="ltx_text">with probability at least <math id="S6.p9.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\exp\left(-2m^{d/(2\gamma+d)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\exp\left(-2m^{d/(2\gamma+d)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>, from which we can immediately obtain</span></p>
