<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.p9.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p9.7.1" class="ltx_text">with probability at least <math id="S6.p9.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-\exp\left(-2m^{d/(2\gamma+d)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-\exp\left(-2m^{d/(2\gamma+d)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S6.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">In the second case, we suppose that <math id="S6.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}\geq\delta\geq 2\left\|\widehat{f}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}\geq\delta\geq 2\left\|\widehat{f}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> holds. It follows that</span></p>
<table id="S6.Ex357" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S6.Ex357.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}^{2}\leq 2\left\|\widehat{f}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}+2\left\|f^{*}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}\leq\frac{1}{2}\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}^{2}+2\left\|f^{*}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}^{2}\leq 2\left\|\widehat{f}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}+2\left\|f^{*}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}\leq\frac{1}{2}\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}^{2}+2\left\|f^{*}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">which implies <math id="S6.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}^{2}\leq 4\left\|f^{*}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{m}^{2}\leq 4\left\|f^{*}-f_{0}\right\|_{m}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence in this case, the inequality (<a href="#S6.E32" title="In Proof of Proposition . ‣ 6 Proof of Proposition ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">32</span></a>) still holds.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S6.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 3: Combine the Results.<span id="S6.p11.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></p>
</div>
<div id="S6.p12" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text">From the conclusion of (<a href="#S6.E28" title="In Proof of Proposition . ‣ 6 Proof of Proposition ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">28</span></a>) in Step 1 and (<a href="#S6.E32" title="In Proof of Proposition . ‣ 6 Proof of Proposition ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">32</span></a>) in Step 2, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="S6.EGx218" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S6.Ex358"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.Ex358.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{L^{2}(\mu)}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\widehat{f}-f^{*}\right\|_{L^{2}(\mu)}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S6.Ex359"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.Ex359.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left(\frac{448B_{\mathcal{F}}^{2}}{3}+2^{16}\sigma^{2}+10\right)m^{-2\gamma/(2\gamma+d)}+\frac{448B_{\mathcal{F}}^{2}\log\mathcal{N}(m^{-\gamma/(2\gamma+d)},\mathcal{F},\|\cdot\|_{L^{\infty}(\mu)})}{3m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>448</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>16</mn></msup><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi><mo>/</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>448</mn><mi>B</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>log</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>/</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left(\frac{448B_{\mathcal{F}}^{2}}{3}+2^{16}\sigma^{2}+10\right)m^{-2\gamma/(2\gamma+d)}+\frac{448B_{\mathcal{F}}^{2}\log\mathcal{N}(m^{-\gamma/(2\gamma+d)},\mathcal{F},\|\cdot\|_{L^{\infty}(\mu)})}{3m}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S6.Ex360"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S6.Ex360.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+72\|f^{*}-f_{0}\|_{m}^{2}+\frac{2^{9}\sigma}{m^{(\gamma+d)/(2\gamma+d)}}\left(\int_{0}^{2^{7}\sigma m^{-\gamma/(2\gamma+d)}}\sqrt{\log 2\mathcal{N}(\varsigma,\mathcal{F},\|\cdot\|_{L^{\infty}(\mu)})^{2}}\,d\varsigma\right)^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>72</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>7</mn></msup><mi>σ</mi><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>/</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msubsup></mstyle><msqrt><mrow><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ς</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>ς</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+72\|f^{*}-f_{0}\|_{m}^{2}+\frac{2^{9}\sigma}{m^{(\gamma+d)/(2\gamma+d)}}\left(\int_{0}^{2^{7}\sigma m^{-\gamma/(2\gamma+d)}}\sqrt{\log 2\mathcal{N}(\varsigma,\mathcal{F},\|\cdot\|_{L^{\infty}(\mu)})^{2}}\,d\varsigma\right)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.p12.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.p12.2.1" class="ltx_text">with probability at least <math id="S6.p12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1-2\exp\left(-m^{d/(2\gamma+d)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1-2\exp\left(-m^{d/(2\gamma+d)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>. We complete the proof by combining this inequality and (<a href="#S6.E24" title="In Proof of Proposition . ‣ 6 Proof of Proposition ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>).
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma4" title="Lemma 4. ‣ 2.3 Proof of Theorem ‣ 2 Proofs of Main Results ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>: Estimation of Lipschitz Constant</h2>

<div id="S7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Lemmas <a href="#Thmlemma24" title="Lemma 24. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>, <a href="#Thmlemma25" title="Lemma 25. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a> and <a href="#Thmlemma27" title="Lemma 27. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">27</span></a>, we derive several key properties of the softmax function.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma24" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 24</span></span><span id="Thmlemma24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma24.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma24.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma24.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For any <math id="Thmlemma24.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{x}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{x}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, there holds</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx219" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex361"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex361.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}\leq 1." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}\leq 1.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S7.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="S7.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]_{i}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]_{i}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S7.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[d]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[d]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx220" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex362"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex362.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}^{2}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]_{i}^{2}\leq\left(\sum_{i=1}^{d}[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]_{i}\right)^{2}=1." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}^{2}=\sum_{i=1}^{d}[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]_{i}^{2}\leq\left(\sum_{i=1}^{d}[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]_{i}\right)^{2}=1.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S7.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma25" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 25</span></span><span id="Thmlemma25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma25.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma25.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma25.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmlemma25.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{x}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{x}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma25.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{y}=\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{y}=\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmlemma25.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{S}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{S}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> be the Jacobian matrix of <math id="Thmlemma25.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{S}</annotation></semantics></math>. There holds</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx221" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex363"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex363.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{x})=\mathrm{diag(\boldsymbol{y})}-\boldsymbol{y}\boldsymbol{y}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝒚</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒚</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{x})=\mathrm{diag(\boldsymbol{y})}-\boldsymbol{y}\boldsymbol{y}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S7.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S7.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="S7.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j\in[d]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j\in[d]</annotation></semantics></math>, direct calculation yields</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx222" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex364"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex364.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial y_{i}}{\partial x_{j}}=\frac{\partial}{\partial x_{j}}\frac{e^{x_{i}}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}=\frac{e^{x_{i}}\delta_{ij}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}-\frac{e^{x_{i}}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}\frac{e^{x_{j}}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial y_{i}}{\partial x_{j}}=\frac{\partial}{\partial x_{j}}\frac{e^{x_{i}}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}=\frac{e^{x_{i}}\delta_{ij}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}-\frac{e^{x_{i}}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}\frac{e^{x_{j}}}{\sum_{k=1}^{d}e^{x_{k}}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma26" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 26</span></span><span id="Thmlemma26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Mean-value theorem for vector-valued functions)<span id="Thmlemma26.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma26.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma26.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma26.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u,v\in\mathbb{N}_{\geq 1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℕ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u,v\in\mathbb{N}_{\geq 1}</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> be an open subset of <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{R}^{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>u</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{R}^{u}</annotation></semantics></math> and assume that <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{f}:S\to\mathbb{R}^{v}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>v</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{f}:S\to\mathbb{R}^{v}</annotation></semantics></math> is differentiable at each point of <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{x}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐲</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{y}</annotation></semantics></math> be two points in <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> such that <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L(\boldsymbol{x},\boldsymbol{y})\subseteq S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>⊆</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L(\boldsymbol{x},\boldsymbol{y})\subseteq S</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L(\boldsymbol{x},\boldsymbol{y}):=\{t\boldsymbol{x}+(1-t)\boldsymbol{y}:t\in[0,1]\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L(\boldsymbol{x},\boldsymbol{y}):=\{t\boldsymbol{x}+(1-t)\boldsymbol{y}:t\in[0,1]\}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then for every vector <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐚</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{a}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{R}^{v}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{R}^{v}</annotation></semantics></math>, there is a point <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐳</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{z}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L(\boldsymbol{x},\boldsymbol{y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L(\boldsymbol{x},\boldsymbol{y})</annotation></semantics></math> such that</span></p>
<table id="S7.Ex365" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S7.Ex365.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{a}^{\top}[\boldsymbol{f}(\boldsymbol{y})-\boldsymbol{f}(\boldsymbol{x})]=\boldsymbol{a}^{\top}\boldsymbol{f}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})(\boldsymbol{y}-\boldsymbol{x})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝒂</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝒇</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒚</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝒇</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒂</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒇</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝒚</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{a}^{\top}[\boldsymbol{f}(\boldsymbol{y})-\boldsymbol{f}(\boldsymbol{x})]=\boldsymbol{a}^{\top}\boldsymbol{f}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})(\boldsymbol{y}-\boldsymbol{x}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma26.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma26.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{f}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{f}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> is the Jacobian matrix of <math id="Thmlemma26.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{f}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{f}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S7.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S7.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">See, for example, <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>, Theorem 12.9]</cite>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma27" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 27</span></span><span id="Thmlemma27.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma27.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma27.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma27.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For any <math id="Thmlemma27.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{x},\widetilde{\boldsymbol{x}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{x},\widetilde{\boldsymbol{x}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, there holds</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx223" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex366"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex366.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{{x}})\|_{2}\leq 2\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{{x}}\|_{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{{x}})\|_{2}\leq 2\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{{x}}\|_{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S7.5" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S7.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Choosing <math id="S7.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{a}=\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒂</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{a}=\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})</annotation></semantics></math> in Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma26" title="Lemma 26 (Mean-value theorem for vector-valued functions). ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">26</span></a>, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx224" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex367"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex367.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]^{\top}[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]=[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]^{\top}\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]^{\top}[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]=[\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})]^{\top}\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{x})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">for some <math id="S7.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{z}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{z}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>. It follows that</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx225" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex368"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex368.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}^{2}\leq\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}\|\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})\|_{2}\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{x}\|_{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}^{2}\leq\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}\|\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})\|_{2}\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{x}\|_{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text">which implies</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx226" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex369"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex369.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}\leq\|\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})\|_{2}\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{x}\|_{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}})-\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{x})\|_{2}\leq\|\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})\|_{2}\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{x}}-\boldsymbol{x}\|_{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p6.4.1" class="ltx_text">Denote <math id="S7.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{y}=\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{z})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒚</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{y}=\sigma_{S}(\boldsymbol{z})</annotation></semantics></math>. By Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma24" title="Lemma 24. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a> and Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma25" title="Lemma 25. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx227" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex370"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex370.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})\|_{2}=\|\mathrm{diag(\boldsymbol{y})}-\boldsymbol{y}\boldsymbol{y}^{\top}\|_{2}\leq\|\mathrm{diag(\boldsymbol{y})}\|_{2}+\|\boldsymbol{y}\|_{2}^{2}\leq 1+1=2." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒛</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝒚</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒚</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝒚</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\sigma_{S}^{\prime}(\boldsymbol{z})\|_{2}=\|\mathrm{diag(\boldsymbol{y})}-\boldsymbol{y}\boldsymbol{y}^{\top}\|_{2}\leq\|\mathrm{diag(\boldsymbol{y})}\|_{2}+\|\boldsymbol{y}\|_{2}^{2}\leq 1+1=2.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p6.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p6.5.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S7.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p7.1" class="ltx_p">In the following three lemmas (Lemmas <a href="#Thmlemma28" title="Lemma 28. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">28</span></a> - <a href="#Thmlemma30" title="Lemma 30. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">30</span></a>), we study properties of single feedforward block <math id="S7.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(in)}\times n}\to\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(out)}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(in)}\times n}\to\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(out)}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math> with depth <math id="S7.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>, width <math id="S7.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math> and weight bound <math id="S7.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{FF}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{FF}</annotation></semantics></math>, taking the form of</p>
<table id="S7.EGx228" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex371"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex371.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex371.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\boldsymbol{X};" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mi>𝑿</mi></mrow><mo>;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\boldsymbol{X};</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex372"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex372.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex372.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma_{R}(\boldsymbol{W}_{l}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l-1}+\boldsymbol{B}_{l}),\quad l\in\{1,2,\dots,L-1\};" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma_{R}(\boldsymbol{W}_{l}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l-1}+\boldsymbol{B}_{l}),\quad l\in\{1,2,\dots,L-1\};</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex373"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex373.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex373.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}+\boldsymbol{B}_{L}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}+\boldsymbol{B}_{L},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p7.2" class="ltx_p">properties of single softmax layer <math id="S7.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n}\to\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n}\to\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math> with head number <math id="S7.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math>, head size <math id="S7.p7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> and weight bound <math id="S7.p7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{SA}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{SA}</annotation></semantics></math>, taking the form of</p>
<table id="S7.EGx229" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex374"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex374.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})=\boldsymbol{Y}+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\boldsymbol{W}_{O}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{W}_{V}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{Y}\sigma_{S}\left(\boldsymbol{Y}^{\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{K}^{(h)\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{Q}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{Y}\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>V</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>K</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒀</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})=\boldsymbol{Y}+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\boldsymbol{W}_{O}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{W}_{V}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{Y}\sigma_{S}\left(\boldsymbol{Y}^{\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{K}^{(h)\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{Q}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{Y}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p7.3" class="ltx_p">and properties of embedding layer <math id="S7.p7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}\times n}\to\mathbb{R}^{d_{EB}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}\times n}\to\mathbb{R}^{d_{EB}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math> with weight bound <math id="S7.p7.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{EB}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{EB}</annotation></semantics></math>, taking the form of</p>
<table id="S7.EGx230" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex375"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex375.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})=\boldsymbol{W}_{EB}\boldsymbol{Z}+\boldsymbol{B}_{EB}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒁</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})=\boldsymbol{W}_{EB}\boldsymbol{Z}+\boldsymbol{B}_{EB}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S7.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Without loss of generality we assume <math id="S7.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{FF},B_{SA},B_{EB}\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{FF},B_{SA},B_{EB}\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma28" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma28.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 28</span></span><span id="Thmlemma28.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma28.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma28.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma28.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For any <math id="Thmlemma28.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(in)}\times n},\boldsymbol{Y}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n},\boldsymbol{Z}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(in)}\times n},\boldsymbol{Y}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n},\boldsymbol{Z}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math>, there holds</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx231" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex376"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex376.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex376.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex377"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex377.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex377.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2d_{SA}\sqrt{n}HSB_{SA}^{2}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2d_{SA}\sqrt{n}HSB_{SA}^{2}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex378"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex378.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex378.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{EB}d_{in}n}B_{EB}\left\|\boldsymbol{Z}\right\|_{F}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{EB}d_{in}n}B_{EB}\left\|\boldsymbol{Z}\right\|_{F}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S7.6" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S7.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="S7.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}</annotation></semantics></math>, by definition we have</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx232" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex379"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex379.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex379.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}+\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}+\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex380"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex380.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex381"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex381.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}+\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}+\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex382"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex382.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\|_{F}\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\|_{F}+\|\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\|_{F},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">where in the third step, we use the property <math id="S7.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{R}(x)\leq x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{R}(x)\leq x</annotation></semantics></math> for any <math id="S7.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\mathbb{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math>. Repeating this process, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx233" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex383"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex383.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex383.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{l=1}^{L}\left(\prod_{l^{\prime}=l+1}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{l^{\prime}}\|_{F}\right)\|\boldsymbol{B}_{l}\|_{F}+\left(\prod_{l=1}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{l}\|_{F}\right)\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{l=1}^{L}\left(\prod_{l^{\prime}=l+1}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{l^{\prime}}\|_{F}\right)\|\boldsymbol{B}_{l}\|_{F}+\left(\prod_{l=1}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{W}_{l}\|_{F}\right)\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex384"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex384.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}+\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}}W^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}+\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}}W^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex385"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex385.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p9.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p9.3.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="S7.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}</annotation></semantics></math>, by definition we have</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx234" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex386"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex386.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex386.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left\|\boldsymbol{W}_{O}^{(h)}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{W}_{V}^{(h)}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}\left\|\sigma_{S}\left(\boldsymbol{Y}^{\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{K}^{(h)\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{Q}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{Y}\right)\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>V</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>K</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒀</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}+\sum_{h=1}^{H}\left\|\boldsymbol{W}_{O}^{(h)}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{W}_{V}^{(h)}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}\left\|\sigma_{S}\left(\boldsymbol{Y}^{\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{K}^{(h)\top}\boldsymbol{W}_{Q}^{(h)}\boldsymbol{Y}\right)\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex387"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex387.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq(d_{SA}\sqrt{n}HSB_{SA}^{2}+1)\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}\leq 2d_{SA}\sqrt{n}HSB_{SA}^{2}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq(d_{SA}\sqrt{n}HSB_{SA}^{2}+1)\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}\leq 2d_{SA}\sqrt{n}HSB_{SA}^{2}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p9.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p9.4.1" class="ltx_text">where in the second step we use Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma24" title="Lemma 24. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>. The bound of <math id="S7.p9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}</annotation></semantics></math> can be obtained directly from the definition.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S7.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma29" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma29.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 29</span></span><span id="Thmlemma29.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma29.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma29.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma29.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varsigma\in\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ς</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varsigma\in\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF},\boldsymbol{{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF},\boldsymbol{{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}</annotation></semantics></math> be two feedforward blocks with each trainable parameter differing by at most <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varsigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ς</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varsigma</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{SA},\boldsymbol{{\mathcal{F}}}_{SA}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{SA},\boldsymbol{{\mathcal{F}}}_{SA}</annotation></semantics></math> be two self-attention layers with each trainable parameter also differing by at most <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varsigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ς</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varsigma</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{EB},\boldsymbol{{\mathcal{F}}}_{EB}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{EB},\boldsymbol{{\mathcal{F}}}_{EB}</annotation></semantics></math> be two embedding layers with each trainable parameter also differing by at most <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varsigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ς</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varsigma</annotation></semantics></math>. For any <math id="Thmlemma29.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(in)}\times n},\boldsymbol{Y}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n},\boldsymbol{Z}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{X}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{FF}^{(in)}\times n},\boldsymbol{Y}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{SA}\times n},\boldsymbol{Z}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math>, there holds</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx235" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex388"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex388.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex388.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 4{d_{FF}^{(in)}\left(d_{FF}^{(out)}\right)^{3/2}}nL^{2}W^{2L-3/2}B_{FF}^{2L-1}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}\varsigma," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ς</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 4{d_{FF}^{(in)}\left(d_{FF}^{(out)}\right)^{3/2}}nL^{2}W^{2L-3/2}B_{FF}^{2L-1}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}\varsigma,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex389"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex389.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}(\boldsymbol{Y})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex389.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 3d_{SA}^{2}\sqrt{n}HS^{2}B_{SA}^{3}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}^{3}\varsigma," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒀</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ς</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 3d_{SA}^{2}\sqrt{n}HS^{2}B_{SA}^{3}\left\|\boldsymbol{Y}\right\|_{F}^{3}\varsigma,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex390"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex390.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{EB}(\boldsymbol{Z})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex390.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{EB}d_{in}n}\left\|\boldsymbol{Z}\right\|_{F}\varsigma." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mi>𝒁</mi><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ς</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq 2\sqrt{d_{EB}d_{in}n}\left\|\boldsymbol{Z}\right\|_{F}\varsigma.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S7.7" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S7.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="S7.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}</annotation></semantics></math>, by definition we have</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx236" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex391"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex391.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex392"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex392.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-1}+\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑩</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-1}+\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex393"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex393.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑩</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex394"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex394.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L-1}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-2}+\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑩</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L-1}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-2}+\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex395"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex395.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑩</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex396"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex396.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-2}-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{\widetilde{F}}}_{L-2}-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-2}\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.Ex397"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex397.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑩</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑩</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L-1}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{W}_{L}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{L-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{L}-\boldsymbol{B}_{L}\right\|_{F},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p11.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p11.2.1" class="ltx_text">where in the third step we use the fact that <math id="S7.p11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{R}</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="S7.p11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math>-Lipschitz. Repeating this process, we obtain</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx237" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex398"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex398.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S7.E33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{l=1}^{L}\left(\prod_{l^{\prime}=l+1}^{L}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{l^{\prime}}\right\|_{F}\right)\left(\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{l}-\boldsymbol{W}_{l}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{l}-\boldsymbol{B}_{l}\right\|_{F}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑾</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑾</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑩</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{l=1}^{L}\left(\prod_{l^{\prime}=l+1}^{L}\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{l^{\prime}}\right\|_{F}\right)\left(\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{W}}_{l}-\boldsymbol{W}_{l}\right\|_{F}\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l-1}\right\|_{F}+\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{B}}_{l}-\boldsymbol{B}_{l}\right\|_{F}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p11.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p11.3.1" class="ltx_text">From the derivation of Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma24" title="Lemma 24. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>, we can find that for <math id="S7.p11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l\in[L]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l\in[L]</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx238" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.E34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.E34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l}\right\|_{F}\leq 2\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{l}\right\|_{F}\leq 2\sqrt{d_{FF}^{(in)}d_{FF}^{(out)}n}LW^{L-1}B_{FF}^{L}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(34)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p11.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p11.4.1" class="ltx_text">Plugging (<a href="#S7.E34" title="In Proof. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>) into (<a href="#S7.E33" title="In Proof. ‣ 7 Proof of Lemma : Estimation of Lipschitz Constant ‣ Standard Transformers Achieve the Minimax Rate in Nonparametric Regression with 𝐶^{𝑠,𝜆} Targets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">33</span></a>), we obtain</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx239" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex399"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S7.Ex399.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}\leq 4{d_{FF}^{(in)}\left(d_{FF}^{(out)}\right)^{3/2}}nL^{2}W^{2L-3/2}B_{FF}^{2L-1}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}\varsigma." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝑿</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ς</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\boldsymbol{\widetilde{\mathcal{F}}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})-\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{FF}(\boldsymbol{X})\right\|_{F}\leq 4{d_{FF}^{(in)}\left(d_{FF}^{(out)}\right)^{3/2}}nL^{2}W^{2L-3/2}B_{FF}^{2L-1}\|\boldsymbol{X}\|_{F}\varsigma.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S7.p11.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p11.5.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="S7.p11.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝓕</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\mathcal{F}}_{SA}</annotation></semantics></math>, by definition we have</span></p>
<table id="S7.EGx240" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S7.Ex400"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
